That's where
my co-host comes in.

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:30.463
TOM MEYERS: (CHUCKLES)
I love your accent.

00:00:30.696 --> 00:00:34.533
Hi, I'm Tom Meyers. I'm from
the<i> Bowery Boys History Podcast,</i>

00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:37.369
which is all about
New York City history,

00:00:37.636 --> 00:00:41.006
including that exciting time
in the late 19th century

00:00:41.106 --> 00:00:42.675
that we call the Gilded Age.

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:44.677
♪ (ORCHESTRAL MUSIC PLAYING) ♪

00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:47.179
ALICIA:
Well, this<i> The Gilded Age</i>

00:00:47.246 --> 00:00:51.150
is a new HBO original series
created by Julian Fellowes

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:55.187
and it's a drama that's set
in late 1800s New York,

00:00:55.254 --> 00:00:59.358
where a social war is raging
between new money and old.

00:00:59.525 --> 00:01:01.294
And after each episode,
you can join us

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:03.495
